  "bear": {
   "thesis": "The evidence does not support the tip\u2019s $100 price target: the available analyst target is far lower, while AMC has continued to report losses and negative operating cash flow. Its share price has also suffered an extreme decline and lagged the S&P 500 over the measured five-year period.",
