    },
    {
     "headline": "Debt remains substantial and equity is negative",
     "detail": "At the end of 2025, long-term debt was $4,018,600,000, cash was $428,500,000, and stockholders\u2019 equity was -$1,894,800,000 (E2). Those figures indicate limited financial cushion relative to debt obligations.",
